# Wave T45 (Heritage kit): heritageroof — Heritage City's own roof, worn by the shipped Gym's tr cells and both facade cottages. TEAL STONE SLATE: deep teal-green stone slates in offset courses, moss flecks in the joints, a pale worn slate here and there — the painting's teal-green stone roofs drawn as CUT STONE courses: unlike Shingle's shellroof (pale shell shingles), Coalseam's ironroof (riveted plate), Revelry's beamroof/condoroof (glass steel) and Honeyfield's bloomroof (petal scales). (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T45-HERITAGE-PLAN.md §5.)
